{"image_segmentation__partitions__an_image_into_distinct_regions_corresponding_to_specific_objects_or_areas_of_interest": "The predicate \"partitions\" describes the action of dividing or segmenting an image into separate regions. This process involves categorizing pixels into different segments based on certain criteria such as color, texture, or intensity, to distinguish between different objects or areas within the image."},
