{"the_efficacy_and_clinical_adoption_of_these_technologies": "The efficacy and clinical adoption of these technologies refers to how well medical image segmentation models perform in practical, real-world medical scenarios and how readily they are accepted and used by healthcare professionals. This includes their effectiveness in improving patient treatment and outcomes."},
