{"low_fidelity_blobby_mask_predictions": "Low-fidelity, blobby mask predictions describe the output of segmentation models that are not accurate or detailed. These predictions are characterized by their lack of precision and the presence of irregular, amorphous shapes that do not closely match the true boundaries of the objects in the image."},
