{"abnormal_medical_features": "Abnormal medical features refer to unusual or atypical characteristics observed in medical images or data, such as lesions, which can indicate potential health issues."},
{"abnormal_medical_features__exhibits__strong_class_imbalance": "The term \"exhibits\" in this context means that abnormal medical features display or show a particular characteristic or property, in this case, a strong class imbalance."},
