{"a_performance_metric_named_balanced_boundary_iou_bbiou": "A performance metric named Balanced Boundary IoU (BBIoU) is a newly developed evaluation metric designed to provide a balanced assessment of both the boundary and inner contour segmentation of objects, addressing the limitations of existing metrics like IoU and BIoU."},
{"balanced_boundary_iou_bbiou": "Balanced Boundary IoU (BBIoU) is a newly developed performance metric designed to provide a fair and comprehensive evaluation of segmentation tasks, particularly in medical imaging. It aims to address the limitations of existing metrics by offering a balanced assessment of both the boundary and inner regions of segmented objects."},
{"balanced_boundary_iou_bbiou__accounts_for__both_object_boundary_and_inner_contour_segmentation": "The term \"accounts for\" in this context means that the Balanced Boundary IoU (BBIoU) metric considers and evaluates both aspects of segmentation\u2014the object boundary and the inner contour\u2014ensuring a more holistic and unbiased assessment."},
