{"a_detailed_step_by_step_description_of_calculating_bbiou": "A detailed, step-by-step description of calculating BBIoU refers to the explicit instructions and procedures given by Algorithm 1. This includes defining boundaries and inner regions of object masks, performing standard Intersection over Union (IoU) calculations, and finally computing the BBIoU score."},
