{"value_of_b": "The value of _b_ refers to a specific parameter used in the BBIoU metric, which is crucial for assessing the performance of models in segmenting object boundaries and inner regions in medical imaging tasks.|Here is another description: The value of _b_ refers to a parameter used in the BBIoU metric algorithm for evaluating the segmentation performance of models in medical imaging tasks. It is crucial for determining the boundary sensitivity of the metric.|Here is another description: The value of _b_ refers to a specific parameter used in the BBIoU metric to assess the performance of a model in segmenting the boundaries of objects. It is a critical component in determining how the boundary patch evaluation is conducted within the algorithm."},
