{"baseline_u_net_model__trained_with__crossentropyloss_as_the_loss_function": "The phrase \"trained with\" indicates the specific configuration and parameters used during the training phase of the U-Net model. This includes the choice of loss function, optimizer, learning rate, and other hyperparameters that influence the model's learning process and final performance."},
