{"stochastic_gradient_descent_sgd_optimizer": "The Stochastic Gradient Descent (SGD) optimizer is a popular optimization algorithm used in machine learning to update model parameters. It works by iteratively adjusting the parameters in the direction that reduces the loss function, using a subset of the training data at each step to estimate the gradient."},
