{"iou__demonstrates__highest_median_values_in_all_datasets": "The predicate \"demonstrates\" indicates that IoU has been observed to exhibit or show a particular characteristic or performance in the context of the comparison. In this case, it highlights IoU's performance relative to other metrics like BIoU and BBIoU across different datasets."},
{"highest_median_values_in_all_datasets": "The highest median values in all datasets refer to the statistical measure where IoU consistently shows superior performance compared to BIoU and BBIoU. This means that across various medical imaging datasets, IoU has the highest central tendency in its distribution of values, indicating better overall performance in those datasets."},
