{"biou__has__sensitivity_to_object_location_and_the_extent_of_boundary_errors": "The predicate \"has\" in this context indicates that BIoU possesses a particular characteristic or trait. Specifically, it highlights an inherent quality of BIoU that distinguishes it from other metrics."},
{"sensitivity_to_object_location_and_the_extent_of_boundary_errors": "The sensitivity to object location and the extent of boundary errors refers to BIoU\u2019s tendency to be significantly affected by the precise positioning of objects and the accuracy of boundary delineation. This sensitivity can limit its overall utility in certain applications."},
{"bbiou__exhibits__median_value_that_falls_between_those_of_iou_and_biou": "The predicate \"exhibits\" indicates that BBIoU demonstrates a specific characteristic or behavior in the context of the comparison with other metrics like IoU and BIoU."},
{"median_value_that_falls_between_those_of_iou_and_biou": "The median value that falls between those of IoU and BIoU represents a balanced performance metric, suggesting that BBIoU offers a more consistent evaluation by accounting for both boundary and inner region accuracy, and is less susceptible to the biases inherent in IoU and BIoU."},
