{"mean_biou_scores": "Mean BIoU scores represent the average values of the Boundary Intersection over Union metric across various datasets, providing an overall measure of boundary delineation accuracy in medical imaging segmentation tasks.|Here is another description: Mean BIoU scores represent the average values of the Boundary Intersection over Union metric across various datasets, providing insights into the performance of models in terms of boundary delineation."},
