{"k_he_g_gkioxari_p_doll\u00e1r_and_r_girshick": "K. He, G. Gkioxari, P. Doll\u00e1r, and R. Girshick are researchers who contributed to the field of computer vision. They are recognized for their work on advancing object detection and segmentation techniques."},
