{"proceedings_of_the_ieee_cvf_winter_conference_on_applications_of_computer_vision": "The object is the \"Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision,\" which is a collection of papers presented at the IEEE/CVF Winter Conference. This conference focuses on the latest research and developments in computer vision applications, providing a platform for researchers to share their findings and innovations.|Here is another description: The Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision is a collection of research papers presented at the conference, focusing on advancements and applications in the field of computer vision."},
