{"u_net_convolutional_networks_for_biomedical_image_segmentation": "\"U-net: Convolutional networks for biomedical image segmentation\" is a research paper presented at the 18th international conference on Medical Image Computing and Computer-Assisted Intervention (MICCAI) in 2015. The paper introduces a novel convolutional network architecture designed specifically for biomedical image segmentation tasks.|Here is another description: \"U-net: Convolutional networks for biomedical image segmentation\" is a research paper that introduces a novel convolutional network architecture designed specifically for the task of biomedical image segmentation. The paper presents the methodology, architecture details, and performance evaluation of the proposed U-net model.|Here is another description: \"U-net: Convolutional networks for biomedical image segmentation\" is a research paper presented at the 18th International Conference on Medical Image Computing and Computer-Assisted Intervention (MICCAI) in 2015. The paper introduces a novel convolutional network architecture designed specifically for biomedical image segmentation tasks."},
