{"error_sensitivity_characteristics_of_standard_segmentation_measures_such_as_iou_and_biou_16": "The object \"error-sensitivity characteristics of standard segmentation measures such as IoU and BIoU [16]\" refers to the study of how sensitive common segmentation metrics (Intersection over Union - IoU, and Boundary Intersection over Union - BIoU) are to different types of errors in segmentation tasks. This involves analyzing how these metrics respond to errors in both the boundary and inner regions of segmented objects."},
