{"grx": "_Grx_ is a specific subset of the ground truth segmentation mask, focusing on the boundary pixels. It is used in conjunction with the proposed BBIoU metric to evaluate the accuracy of segmentation algorithms by considering both the boundary and inner regions of the segmented object."},
