{"this_flexibility_is_a_key_strength_of_bbiou": "This flexibility refers to the adaptability of the BBIoU metric to different medical imaging tasks with varying precision needs. It is a key strength of BBIoU, allowing the boundary sensitivity of the metric to be customized according to the structural characteristics of the dataset, whether for fine details or coarser structures."},
