{"0_08_0_70_0_79_0_62_0_74_0_88_0_87": "The objects \"0.08, 0.70, 0.79, 0.62, 0.74, 0.88, 0.87\" are the specific F-measure values derived from the evaluation of a classification model. Each value corresponds to the F-measure calculated under distinct experimental or operational conditions, showcasing the model's performance across various scenarios."},
