{"gt3__had__substantial_boundary_misalignment": "The predicate \"had\" indicates that GT3 experienced or was characterized by a particular issue. In this context, it signifies that GT3 was affected by substantial boundary misalignment in its predicted mask."},
{"substantial_boundary_misalignment": "Substantial boundary misalignment refers to a significant discrepancy between the predicted boundary of an object and its actual boundary. In the context of GT3, this misalignment resulted in a low BIoU score despite a high IoU score, highlighting the limitations of IoU in evaluating the quality of predicted masks."},
{"gt3__had__low_biou_score": "The predicate \"had\" indicates that GT3 experienced or was characterized by a particular condition or metric value during the qualitative assessment. In this context, it signifies that GT3 was associated with a specific BIoU score."},
{"low_biou_score": "A low BIoU score indicates that despite potentially high IoU scores, the boundary alignment and mask quality were poor. In the case of GT3, this low BIoU score was due to substantial boundary misalignment, even though the IoU remained high because of a large area of pixel overlap."},
